 *   get_integer(t,c): ctx99=c*99; escapes get_bit(t+k+ctx99) until 1 (k>=1),
 *     then (t+k-1) data bits get_bit(ctx99); value=2^(t+k-1)+data-2^t.
 *   get_bit: if(range<255){range*=255;fraction*=255;fraction+=byte-1;}
